w strategy for victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288310/extras/44326e9f5e84aaccf02e6a5ea31cbb04.poster.avif?t=1781203791\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288310/extras/44326e9f5e84aaccf02e6a5ea31cbb04.webm?t=1781203791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288310/extras/44326e9f5e84aaccf02e6a5ea31cbb04.mp4?t=1781203791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288310/extras/9dd9ebcdc5f30a2fd08717aeb546519d.avif?t=1781203791\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288310/extras_big/9dd9ebcdc5f30a2fd08717aeb546519d.webp?t=1781203791 width=1560 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bounce</strong> around various funky environments and interact with hazards to eliminate your friends or push yourself closer to the bubble trophy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288310/extras/15b6e797a8c7a72473e0ce31efa39f06.poster.avif?t=1781203791\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288310/extras/15b6e797a8c7a72473e0ce31efa39f06.webm?t=1781203791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288310/extras/15b6e797a8c7a72473e0ce31efa39f06.mp4?t=1781203791\" type=\